    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d88">

                <pb facs="0204" n="100" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg100"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/1575.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 28, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs requests me to express the desire of President
                    Yuan for immediate recognition by the United States, and in view of the tension
                    existing I add my recommendation thereof. President Yuan believes such
                    recognition would greatly strengthen his Government in popular esteem and also
                    with the Assembly, which will soon convene.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
